# curve-values (H6): x² at a=2, h=1, k=-3 at rest. The vertex sits at
# (1, 3): the solid curve through it, the dashed original (x²) behind.
# Behaviour: views shown line {a:2, b:1, h:1, k:-3}; url line
# func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 2000
shot curve-values
